\par\par \b \uc2 TAKE-A-LOOK-Chile grapples with peso, rates amid rebound\b0\par\par\uc2 465 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 November 2010\par 23:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its benchmark rate by 25 basis points to 3 percent on Tuesday, as expected, sticking with a slower pace of rate increases as a stronger peso helps rein in inflation.\par \par \uc2 For stories, please double click on the codes in brackets:\par \par \uc2 LATEST NEWS\par \par \uc2 RATE RISE CYCLE > Chile cenbank hikes key rate by 25 bps to 3 pct [ID:nN16125546] > Chile seen upping rate with pauses to come-cbank [ID:nN15274952] \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par > FACTBOX-Latin American interest rates            [ID:nN14153782]\par > Chile peso weighed on cenbank hike pace-minutes  [ID:nSAG002645]\par  ECONOMIC RECOVERY\par > Chile peso weighs on inflation, trade balance    [ID:nN08201233]\par > Chile IMACEC up surprise 0.4 pct in Sept vs Aug  [ID:nN05285570]\par > Chile jobless rate falls to 8 pct in July-Sept   [ID:nSAG002646]\par > \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  likelier than 3 mo ago-Cenbank   [ID:nN29196614]\par > \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Chile\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  acts to help exporters hit by strong peso  [ID:nN21292275]\par > Chile domestic demand, inflation moderate-cbank  [ID:nN13273610]\par > INTERVIEW-Chile plans no \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  controls-finmin   [ID:nN08249033]\par > Chile Sept CPI up 0.4 pct, as expected           [ID:nN08252592]\par > Chile Sept trade surplus widens vs Aug           [ID:nN07148093]\par > Chile economy dips in Aug; fast growth seen      [ID:nN05177338]\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 > IMF says Chile on track, warns of capital inflow [ID:nN29258501] > Chile exporters urge cenbank to curb strong peso [ID:nN28145977]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \