\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Peso Ends Weaker Reducing Likelihood Of  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Anthony Esposito   \par \uc2 of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 309 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Oktober 2010\par 19:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso ended weaker against the dollar Friday as investors snapped up greenbacks prior to the weekend, helping to reduce the specter of imminent \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In thin trading, the peso weakened to CLP486.90 to the dollar, versus Thursday's close of CLP485.30, while trading in a range of CLP485.30 to CLP488.10.\par \par \uc2 With the peso trading recently at 29-month highs versus the dollar, exporters have demanded \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, as the peso's strength hurts the competitiveness of their products.\par \par \uc2 The peso, however, has posted a sharp turn around over the last two weeks from its more than two-year high, losing 2.4% versus the dollar over that time.\par \par \uc2 "The government and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  are going to avoid direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at all costs. With the peso already losing steam over the last couple of weeks, the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is greatly reduced," said Sebastian Momberg, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader with investment bank BCI.\par \par \uc2 Traders say, though, that if the peso appreciates to CLP450-CLP460, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will likely be prompted to act.\par \par \uc2 Chile's government announced Thursday that it will cut red tape for exporters in an effort to improve the competitiveness of their products\par \par \uc2 In the bond market, yields on inflation-indexed Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bonds, or BCUs, ended higher in light over-the-counter trading.\par \par \uc2 The yield on five-year BCU bonds ended at 2.70%, from 2.65% on Thursday, while the yield on 10-year BCUs closed at 3.10%, from 3.06% the prior session.\par \par \uc2 (Peso and bond quotes provided by Valor Futuro newswire.)\par \par \uc2 -By Anthony Esposito, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-715-8929; anthony.esposito@dowjones.com [ 22-10-10 1722GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1170 1844   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020101022e6am001cn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
