22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jose De Gregorio said last Wednesday, saying the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was approaching the stronger end of levels justified by fundamentals. [ID:nN06248445] (Reporting by Brad Haynes and Froilan Romero; Editing by James Dalgleish)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CHILE/PESO (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|RNP|DNP    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101012e6ac00142\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
