\par\par \b \uc2 INTERVIEW-UPDATE 1-Chile plans no  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  controls - finmin\b0\par\par\uc2 340 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2010\par 22:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * No plans for \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  flow controls\par \par \uc2 * Larrain says there is no \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been weighing \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Updates with quotes, details throughout)\par \par \uc2 By Christopher Langner\par \par \uc2 NEW YORK, Oct 8 (Reuters) - Chile's government has no plans to impose \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls amid a sharp peso rally or change hedging rules for pension funds, Finance Minister Felipe Larrain told Reuters in an interview on Friday.\par \par \uc2 "I want to state clearly that there is no form of exchange control in our program," Larrain said. "However, we want a diversified economy and exchange rate appreciation is affecting our agriculture and industry."\par \par \uc2 "There is no \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war," he said, but added: "We want to give more certainty to those who participate in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market."\par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso <CLP=CL> has appreciated around 13 percent against the dollar since the beginning of July as rising interest rates attract foreign investment and strengthen the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- a pattern seen around Latin America.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weighed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt a sharp appreciation of the peso, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jose De Gregorio said on Wednesday, noting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was approaching the stronger end of levels justified by fundamentals. For details, see [ID:nN06248445]\par \par \uc2 De Gregorio met with Chile's finance minister and president earlier this week after President Sebastian Pinera said on Sunday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should do more to slow the peso's rise. [ID:nN04108417]\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board members agreed that if the appreciation of the peso continues, it could have implications for monetary policy, minutes from September's policy meeting showed on Tuesday. [ID:nSGO002032]\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's last major \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was in 2008, after the peso appreciated sharply amid a commodity-led boom. It gave the market a clear calendar outlining plans to buy $8 billion via auction. <^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ TAKE-A-LOOK Chile's economy recovery [ID:nN30113748] ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^>\par \par \uc2 CHILE-LARRAIN/PESO (INTERVIEW, UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|E|RBN|D|M   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101011e6a8001eh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
