\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  central banker weighs peso  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 632 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Oktober 2010\par 15:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Cenbank: peso nearing limits justified by fundamentals\par \par \uc2 * Political pressure rising for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 * Peso has appreciated more than 13 pct since July (Updates with speech to lower house, rate details)\par \par \uc2 By Brad Haynes\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Oct 6 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weighed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt a sharp appreciation of the peso, bank President Jose De Gregorio said on Wednesday, noting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was approaching the stronger end of levels justified by fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso <CLP=CL> has appreciated over 13 percent against the dollar since the beginning of July as rising interest rates attract foreign investment and strengthen the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a pattern seen around Latin America.\par \par \uc2 "Decisions on the timing and magnitude of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are constantly evaluated by the board, and it has been an issue in our discussions in recent weeks in terms of weighing the benefits and costs," he told the lower house of Congress in a special session about the peso's sharp rise.\par \par \uc2 De Gregorio earlier told a forum of fruit exporters the exchange rate was pushing the limits of its fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a valid and effective tool when it can affect the exchange rate and strengthen the position of the nation," he said. "Frequent and repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is less effective, so it must be exceptional to give financial markets relevant information."\par \par \uc2 The peso closed 0.12 percent firmer at 482.20/482.70 to the \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar on Wednesday, boosted by stronger prices for copper --\par the country's main export -- and widespread dollar weakness.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 But traders said De Gregorio's comments did not move the peso.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 De Gregorio met with Chile's finance minister and president earlier this week after President Sebastian Pinera said on Sunday that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  should do more to slow the peso's rise. For details, see [ID:nN04108417] <^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ TAKE-A-LOOK Chile's economy recovery [ID:nN30113748] ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^>\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bank board member Rodrigo Vergara told a local newspaper on Sunday that the exchange rate was closer to exiting its acceptable range, marking a change in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's stance and seen as raising the possibility of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . [ID:nN03269364]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's last major \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was in 2008, after the peso appreciated sharply amid a commodity-led boom. It gave the market a clear calendar outlining plans to buy $8 billion via auction.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 STRONG PESO WEIGHS ON RATES\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  board members agreed that if the appreciation of the peso continues, it could have implications for monetary policy, minutes from September's policy meeting showed on Tuesday. [ID:nSGO002032]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 At that meeting, the bank considered slowing the pace of its rate hikes to 25 basis points, which would help counter upward pressure on the peso, but ultimately opted for a fourth consecutive 50 basis point increase. [ID:nN16244652]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 De Gregorio's comments on Wednesday came as global policymakers clashed over \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policies and Western leaders warned China and other emerging markets that widespread efforts to weaken exchange rates threaten to derail the economic recovery. [ID:nLDE6950OG]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Using exchange rates "as a policy weapon" to undercut other economies and boost a country's own exporters "would represent a very serious risk to the global recovery," IMF Managing Director Dominique Strauss-Kahn was quoted as saying in Wednesday's edition of the Financial Times. [ID:nLDE6942A2]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Chile has so far avoided the measures implemented in Brazil, Colombia and Peru. [ID:nSGE69503F]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Brazil fired the latest shot this week in what its finance minister dubbed an "international \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  war," doubling a tax on foreign investors buying local bonds to 4.0 percent in an effort to curb its strong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . [ID:nN04132890]\f28 \par \par \uc2 CHILE-CENBANK/GREGORIO (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|U|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101006e6a6000ze\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
