\par\par \b \uc2 FXNEWS- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  peso slips on USD strength,  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  talk\b0\par\par\uc2 210 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Oktober 2010\par 16:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso <CLP=CL> <CLP=> was 0.5 percent weaker at 483.00/483.50 to the dollar in early Monday trade as the dollar recovered against a basket of world \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the market internalized authorities' weekend comments on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "We don't have much new information in the local market, so we're closely following the behavior of the dollar abroad, which is appreciating against world \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a trader in Santiago.\par \par \uc2 President Sebastian Pinera said on Sunday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should do more to tame a stronger peso, while a bank board member said the local exchange rate is closer to exiting its acceptable range. For details see [ID:nN03269364]\par \par \uc2 Interest rate futures show the market is expecting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to raise its benchmark interest rate by either 25 basis points or 50 basis points in October, bringing the key rate to 3.25 percent rate by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Rate futures have come down since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president said last month that the strength of the peso was slowing the pace of the monetary tightening cycle. For details, see [ID:nN24245807]\par \par \uc2 SNIPPET/|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|RNP|PCO   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101004e6a400135\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
