\par\par \b \uc2 Chile Peso Ends 1.1% Weaker As  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Doesn't Rule Out  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Anthony Esposito   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 494 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Oktober 2010\par 19:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso ended 1.1% weaker against the dollar Monday, coming off a recent 28-month high, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 The peso ended at CLP486.40 to the dollar compared with Friday's close of CLP481.00.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had maintained in recent weeks that the peso was trading in line with its long-term fundamentals. With the peso continuing to gain, however--having appreciated more than 9% on the dollar since the end of the second quarter--the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is closer to straying away from its long-term fundamentals, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Rodrigo Vergara told daily newspaper La Tercera Sunday.\par \par \uc2 He said that the bank is keeping a close eye on the strengthening peso, adding "\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is a tool that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't rule out, although it is only used in exceptional circumstances."\par \par \uc2 As Chile's economy is highly dependent on exports, especially the agricultural and industrial sectors, and the strength of the peso hurts the competitiveness of those products, exporters are demanding \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's President Sebastian Pinera said he plans to discuss with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  shortly how the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  can better coordinate its monetary and exchange-rate policies with the government's fiscal and macroeconomic policies, in order to reach a competitive exchange rate that helps exporters, in particular the agricultural sector. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, is an independent body and has complete autonomy over its decisions.\par \par \uc2 "This verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor and President Pinera helped tamp down the peso's rise. But, if the market doesn't see concrete action, there's a good chance the peso will again start to strengthen," said Rodrigo Sarria, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader with local investment bank Celfin Capital.\par \par \uc2 Also helping to weaken the peso was the euro's fall against the dollar. As Europe is one of Chile's main trading partners, the peso often moves in the same direction as the euro does against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The euro fell against the dollar in the wake of further details on the extent of Ireland's budget deficit and a mixed bag of U.S. economic data.\par \par \uc2 In the bond market, yields on inflation-indexed Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bonds, or BCUs, ended higher as institutional investors sold bonds, triggering stop-loss orders, a local fixed-income trader said.\par \par \uc2 The yield on five-year BCU bonds ended at 2.76%, up from 2.72% Friday, while the yield on 10-year BCUs closed at 3.08%, up from 2.99% the previous session.\par \par \uc2 (Peso and bond quotes provided by Valor Futuro newswire.)\par \par \uc2 -By Anthony Esposito, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-715-8929; anthony.esposito@dowjones.com [ 04-10-10 1807GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1170 1844   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020101004e6a40015f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
