\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Brazil real tests cenbank patience\b0\par\par\uc2 535 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 2010\par 15:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2 * U.S. retail data raises hopes about global recovery\par \par \uc2 * Chile's peso gains 0.2 pct, Mexican peso adds 0.3 pct\par \par \uc2 * Brazilian real gets close to 1.70 level (Adds comments, updates prices)\par \par \uc2 By Samantha Pearson and Jean Luis Arce\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO/MEXICO CITY, Sept 14 (Reuters) - The Brazilian real hit a fresh 2010 high on Tuesday as investors bet on massive future investment in Latin America's biggest economy.\par \par \uc2 Strong U.S. retail data also helped to boost the region's \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , allowing the Mexican peso to shrug off early losses. For details, see [ID:nN14247794]\par \par \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stepped up \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  efforts to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a bid to protect exporters, but so far it has failed to halt the real's rally.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real <BRL=> was bid 0.32 percent stronger at 1.7041 reais per U.S. dollar, according to the international reference rate. It was trading at 1.703 on the local spot market <BRBY>, its strongest level since Dec. 4, 2009.\par \par \uc2 "The market is testing the government's willingness, and they will continue to take the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower," said one head \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader in New York.\par \par \uc2 Brazil plans to sell $500 million more of its 2041 global bonds, underscoring a growing foreign interest in the country's markets.\par \par \uc2 Investors are also optimistic about huge foreign investment in an upcoming fundraising deal by state-owned oil company \uc2 Petrobras\uc2  and a wave of other local corporate deals.\par \par \uc2 But if the real breaks the closely watched 1.70-per-dollar level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be forced to be more aggressive in the market, analysts said.\par \par \uc2 Authorities have already been increasing dollar purchases in the spot market, calling multiple auctions each day, but some believe they may also start \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the futures market via derivatives called "reverse swaps."\par \par \uc2 MEXICAN PESO REVERSES GAINS\par \par \uc2 The Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <MXN=> gained 0.25 percent to 12.8215 per dollar for a three-week high after the strong U.S. data raised hopes about the global economic recovery.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had weakened earlier in the session as investors remained cautious after a rally in the region Monday.\par \par \uc2 Mexico's fragile recovery from a deep recession is dependent on U.S. growth because it sends about 80 percent of its exports to its northern neighbor.\par \par \uc2 "The good data in the United States prompted another round of risk-taking," said Daniela Blancas, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Scotia Capital in Mexico City.\par \par \uc2 But she said volume was relatively low due to an upcoming public holiday in the country.\par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso <CLP=> gained 0.22 percent to 493.40 per dollar as the price of copper, the country's main export, recouped early losses.\par \par \uc2 "In \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a scenario of rising risk appetite and rates normalization will continue to push the Chilean peso higher," \uc2 BNP Paribas\uc2  analysts said in a note.\par \par \uc2 While they recommend buying the Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , they believe future gains in the Brazilian real will be capped by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . (Editing by Jeffrey Benkoe)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|U|RBN|D|M|RNP|DNP    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100917e69e000zp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
