\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Chile central bank \highlight\uc2  doesn't rule out peso  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 427 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 August 2010\par 15:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Peso in line with longer-term fundamentals-De Gregorio\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 * Peso has retreated slightly from seven-month highs (Updates with fresh De Gregorio comment, details)\par \par \uc2 By Ignacio Badal\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Aug 24 (Reuters) - Chile's peso is in line with longer-term fundamentals in real terms, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jose De Gregorio said on Tuesday, while warning the bank can \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in exceptional circumstances.\par \par \uc2 The peso <CLP=CL> recently surged to seven-month highs, boosted by strong prices for copper, Chile's top export, and higher interest rates that have lured investment. The rising \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  prompted warnings from President Sebastian Pinera and Finance Minister Felipe Larrain.\par \par \uc2 "The floating exchange rate allows for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in exceptional cases, as we have done on previous occasions," De Gregorio said in a presentation uploaded to the bank's Web site.\par \par \uc2 "A floating exchange rate regime can bring with it exchange rate volatility and uncertainty, at least in the short-term," he added. "However, those costs do not counter the benefits of floating."\par \par \uc2 When the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced its last major \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2008, after the peso appreciated sharply amid a commodity boom, it gave the market a clear calendar outlining plans to buy $8 billion dollars via auction.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not renounce the use of its instruments, but their use will depend on the board's evaluation that their benefits and effectiveness outweigh their cost," De Gregorio said.\par \par \uc2 The peso has eased back in recent sessions and was weaker on Tuesday, little moved after De Gregorio spoke.\par \par \uc2 Larrain on Thursday warned investors that authorities could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem a sharp appreciation of the local peso. For more, see [ID:nN19246318].\par \par \uc2 Some analysts believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would only move if the peso firmed beyond 480 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Analysts expect South American policy makers to step up \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem surging \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  but caution that doing so risks stoking inflation and say it could ultimately put the brakes on a regional interest rate up-cycle. [ID:N17270580]\par \par \uc2 Peru has aggressively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year to counter sharp gains by its sol \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <PEN=PE>, which is around two-year highs, while Colombia is looking at measures to give businesses relief from \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength. [ID:nN18206932] (With reporting by Antonio de la Jara and Molly Rosbach; Writing by Simon Gardner; Editing by Paul Simao)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CHILE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CENBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|U|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100824e68o000uf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
