\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2 's peso firms despite  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  talk\b0\par\par\uc2 805 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 2010\par 18:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Region's main \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  shrug off euro zone concerns\par \par \uc2 * Brazil's real flat, Mexican peso firms 0.45 pct\par \par \uc2 * Colombia peso dips after Santos hints at \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Adds comments, updates prices)\par \par \uc2 By Samantha Pearson and Froilan Romero\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO/SANTIAGO, Aug 12 (Reuters) - The Chilean peso <CLP=CL> climbed to its strongest level in five months on Thursday in spite of government talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , while the region's other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  shook off early losses.\par \par \uc2 Chilean President Sebastian Pinera said on Thursday he was worried about sharp appreciation of the peso and said his government would use all macroeconomic tools available to keep it competitive.\par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso <CLP=> pared gains slightly after the comments but was still 0.59 percent firmer at 509.20 per dollar, trading at its strongest level since March 8.\par \par \uc2 Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to raise its benchmark interest rate by 50 basis points to 2 percent later on Thursday as the country's economy bounces back from a devastating earthquake in February more quickly than expected. For details, see [ID:nN0965183]\par \par \uc2 "Projections for the interest rate are still around 3.75 percent by year-end, with a 50 basis point increase in August, although we're not ruling out the option that at this meeting we could see a 75 point hike, in accordance with what the swap rates are showing," one trader in Santiago said.\par \par \uc2 "From a technical point of view, there are a lot of dollars coming in," said Flavia Cattan-Naslausky, a strategist at RBS Securities in Stamford, Connecticut.\par \par \uc2 The recent rise in the peso was initially triggered by the revelation by the Chilean government about a month ago that it had started to cash in its copper revenues to help rebuild the country after the earthquake, said Cattan-Naslausky.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso has strengthened about 6 percent since the beginning of July, outperforming the region.\par \par \uc2 But she said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market could be difficult.\par \par \uc2 The fact that \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  is " selling dollars for pesos in the market (as part of cashing in copper windfalls) means it would be counter-intuitive that they would come back into the market to buy those dollars," she said. "But it's possible."\par \par \uc2 Colombia's peso also firmed in early trading to a fresh two-year high, a further sign the performance of Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  is beginning to diverge.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Brazil and Mexico suffered early losses on fears that a sharp slowdown in the United States and Europe could reduce demand for the region's exports.\par \par \uc2 Mexico's peso hit a three-week low after an unexpected rise in new claims for unemployment in the U.S., Mexico's top trading partner.\par \par \uc2 But the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <MXN=> recovered to trade 0.45 percent stronger at 12.718 per dollar, helped by flows into Mexico's peso bonds, traders in Mexico City said.\par \par \uc2 In separate economic reports, industrial production in the euro zone also dropped unexpectedly in June, and Greece's economy shrank more than forecast in the second quarter. [ID:nLDE67B0S3] and [ID:nLDE67B0TH].\par \par \uc2 On the local spot market, the bid quote for the Brazilian real <BRBY> was flat at 1.768 against the U.S. dollar after paring early losses.\par \par \uc2 COLOMBIA ALSO SIGNALS \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Colombia's peso <COP=STFX> firmed to its strongest level since August 2008 in early trading but was later 1.1 percent weaker at 1,822 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Colombian President Juan Manuel Santos has said that he will ask the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be "creative" in dealing with the Andean country's appreciating peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a meeting on Thursday. [ID:nN12110755]\par \par \uc2 The lack of a threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market had been one of the main reasons for the outperformance of the peso, according to a note released earlier on Thursday by analysts at \uc2 HSBC\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The Colombian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been boosted by the re-establishment of diplomatic ties between Colombia and Venezuela.\par \par \uc2 The country is also expected to see a rush of about $10 billion in direct foreign investment in its oil and mining industries this year, and the government estimates that exports will reach a record $40 billion.\par \par \uc2 "In contrast the Brazilian real looks vulnerable from the perspective of strong official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and positioning," \uc2 HSBC\uc2  analysts wrote. "The Mexican peso, despite being cheap from a historical REER (Real Effective Exchange Rate) valuation perspective, carries vulnerability from worsening U.S. sentiment and growth."\par \par \uc2 The REER is a weighted average of a country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , relative to a basket of other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , adjusted for inflation.\par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by Molly Rosbach in Santiago and Michael O'Boyle in Mexico City) (Editing by Theodore d'Afflisio)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100815e68c000a5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
