\par\par \b \uc2 Chile stocks hit new life high, peso at 19-mo peak\b0\par\par\uc2 592 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Januar 2010\par 22:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Stocks at new life high led by commodity shares\par \par \uc2 * Peso hits 19-month high on copper and weak dlr\par \par \uc2 By Aaron Nelsen\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Jan 11 (Reuters) - Chile's bourse closed at a record high on Monday, led by demand for commodity stocks, while the peso strengthened on wider dollar weakness and rising prices for main export copper.\par \par \uc2 The IPSA blue-chip share index <.IPSA> rose 0.47 percent to close at 3,744.17 points, while the all-share IGPA <.IGPA> index closed 0.41 percent higher at 17,264.89. The IPSA has hit a string of 11 consecutive life highs in recent sessions.\par \par \uc2 The bourse gained nearly 51 percent last year as utility, retail and commodity stocks fueled the biggest annual rise in 16 years. Analysts expect the bourse to continue to forge ahead in coming months.\par \par \uc2 "Commodities lifted the bourse last week and lifted the bourse again today," said Alexis Olivares, senior analyst with BBVA Research. "Market sentiment is extremely positive and that's reflected in commodity prices."\par \par \uc2 Investor optimism about the recovery of the Chilean economy after the global financial crisis hit key exports such as copper and has also driven recent bourse gains.\par \par \uc2 Shares in Soquimich , Chile's leading exporter of fertilizer and the world's biggest producer of iodine and lithium, surged 1.36 percent to close at 21,350 pesos.\par \par \uc2 Shares of forestry group CMPC closed 1.54 percent higher at 21,910 pesos per share. Chilean iron and steel producer CAP closed 1.72 percent higher at 16,250 pesos.\par \par \uc2 Energy stocks also gained, led by Chile-based regional group \uc2 Enersis\uc2  . They rose 0.50 percent to 231 pesos, while electricity generator \uc2 Endesa Chile\uc2  closed 0.71 percent higher at 885 pesos.\par \par \uc2 Profit taking in the banking sector limited bourse gains, led by a 1.18 percent fall in shares of Santander Chile , the nation's largest private sector bank. Santander stocks ended 1.18 percent weaker at 32.7 pesos per share.\par \par \uc2 Earlier in the day Chile's peso <CLP=CL> closed up 0.78 percent, hitting a 19-month high on wider dollar weakness and higher copper prices.\par \par \uc2 The peso rose to 489.50/490.00 per dollar, compared with Friday's close of 493.30/493.80.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso has appreciated sharply in recent months, prompting \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jose De Gregorio to warn of possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to tame the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rally in the world's top copper producer.\par \par \uc2 However, in an apparent shift, De Gregorio warned in an interview published on Sunday that "addiction" to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was dangerous. He said \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's flexible exchange rate has helped the country cope with the global financial crisis and any attempt to fix it would also be "extremely dangerous."\par \par \uc2 "The dollar is weakening against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  abroad. Add to that higher copper prices and positive global bourses. In other words all the fundamentals favor peso appreciation," said one local trader.\par \par \uc2 Strong demand for copper in China drove prices higher on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The peso rose more than 26 percent against the dollar in 2009 on dollar weakness, the closing out of carry trades and a sharp rise in prices for copper, Chile's main export.\par \par \uc2 The peso, which fell 22.3 percent in 2008, has climbed 3.58 percent so far in January.\par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by Carlos Romero and Maria Jose Latorre; Editing by Simon Gardner and Andrew Hay)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CHILE|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100111e61b001jx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
