\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  cbank warns  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  'addiction' dangerous\b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Januar 2010\par 17:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Jan 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's flexible exchange rate has helped the country cope with the global financial crisis, and any attempt to fix it is "extremely dangerous," Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jose De Gregorio said in an interview published on Sunday.\par \par \uc2 De Gregorio told daily El Mercurio's Sunday edition that "addiction" to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also dangerous. His comments contrast with repeated verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  warnings in recent months amid a sharp appreciation of the local peso <CLP=CL>, which is near 18-month highs on dollar sales and high prices of No. 1 export, copper.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso appreciated 26 percent against the dollar in 2009, after a 22.3 percent depreciation in 2008, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had warned repeatedly it reserved the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in exceptional circumstances.\par \par \uc2 "Often there is temptation to try to fix the exchange rate, and that is an extremely dangerous path," De Gregorio told the paper.\par \par \uc2 "The worst risk is what I call \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  addiction," he added. "In the end, they are ineffective and the first step towards rigidities, and are very harmful in the medium term."\par \par \uc2 The last time the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was in 2008, when the peso hit levels of 430 per dollar. It \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  through a program of dollar purchases to boost international reserves and weaken the peso.\par \par \uc2 De Gregorio warned as recently as mid-December that the bank was closely monitoring the peso and did not rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it saw significant imbalances. (Reporting by Rodrigo Martinez; Writing by Simon Gardner; Editing by Maureen Bavdek)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CHILE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CENBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|E|U|RBN|M|D|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100110e61a000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
