\par\par \b \uc2 Chile stocks flirt with lifetime highs, peso dips\b0\par\par\uc2 609 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Dezember 2009\par 22:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Leading shares near lifetime highs\par \par \uc2 * Peso ends lower as dollar gains abroad\par \par \uc2 By Alonso Soto and Froilan Romero\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Dec 18 (Reuters) - Chile's leading share index closed within a hair's breadth of all-time highs on Friday, led by gains in utility and retail stocks, while the peso fell as the dollar firmed abroad on signs of improvement in the U.S. economy, traders said.\par \par \uc2 Chile's blue-chip IPSA index <.IPSA> rose 0.47 percent to 3,499.07 points in the last minutes of trading after being mostly flat during the day, while the all-market <.IGPA> ended up 0.4 percent at 16,283.78 points.\par \par \uc2 The IPSA, which is up 47 percent in the year-to-date, is a shade away from its record closing high of 3,499.50 points, set on July 3, 2007. The IPSA hit an all-time intraday high of 3,512.19 points, on Oct. 26, 2007.\par \par \uc2 "We have seen some gains in the electricity sector," said Alexis Olivares, an analyst with BBVA Research. "The electricity sector still has room to grow."\par \par \uc2 Shares in Chile-based regional energy group \uc2 Enersis\uc2  rose 1.28 percent to end at 212 pesos.\par \par \uc2 Retailer \uc2 Cencosud\uc2  , one of Latin America's largest retailers, rose 0.20 percent to 1,695 pesos per share, while competitor La Polar rose 1.62 percent to 2,835 pesos.\par \par \uc2 Industrial conglomerate Copec , one of the world's biggest wood pulp exporters and the most heavily-weighted stock on the local exchange, rose 0.65 percent to 7,550 pesos.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso weakened on Friday as the U.S. dollar strengthened broadly on signs of improvement of the U.S. economy, while the country's leading share index ended higher led by utility and retail shares.\par \par \uc2 The peso <CLP=CL> weakened 0.69 percent to close at 503.80/504.30 per U.S. dollar, compared to Thursday's close of 500.30/500.80. The peso is up around 27 percent against the dollar so far in the year-to-date.\par \par \uc2 "All emerging markets \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are falling, which reflects the dollar appreciation in major markets," a local trader said.\par \par \uc2 The dollar rose broadly on Friday and was on track for its biggest weekly gain against the euro since April as investors who sold the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively in 2009 bought it back as year-end approached. For details, see [ID:nN18235960]\par \par \uc2 Signs of improvement in the U.S. economy have helped the dollar in recent days, as did the Federal Reserve's pledge this week to wind down most emergency lending by February, lifting hopes of a more robust U.S. recovery in 2010.\par \par \uc2 The dollar also attracted safe-haven inflows after Iraq said Iranian troops had crossed into its territory and raised an Iranian flag at a disputed oil field -- a report Tehran denied.\par \par \uc2 The dollar often rallies when investors move their money from riskier assets, including investments in emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to the safe-haven greenback. Other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Latin America such as the Mexican peso <MXN=> and the Brazilian real <BRBY> booked losses on the stronger dollar this week.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jose De Gregorio on Friday issued a fresh warning of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the peso's sharp gains this year, saying the bank did not rule out taking measures if it sees "significant imbalances." [ID:nN18160138]\par \par \uc2 The peso hit 17-month highs in late November, and the bank has fired several salvos of verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since.\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 CHILE\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|U|D|M|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020091218e5ci001t2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
