\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  cenbank to monitor firm peso, may  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Dezember 2009\par 16:06\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, Dec 18 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Jose De Gregorio said on Friday the bank will continue to monitor the strengthening peso although it was not behaving all that differently from other emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2  De Gregorio told a meeting of business leaders the bank did not rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it sees "significant imbalances."\par \par \uc2  The peso hit 17-month highs in late November, prompting the bank then to warn of possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2  Analysts say the bank will likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the peso hits 480 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2  The peso <CLP=CL> weakened 0.40 percent to around 502 per  dollar in mid-morning trading on Friday on broad dollar strength. The peso has gained nearly 30 percent this year.\par \par \uc2  The dollar rose against the euro and yen after reports that Iranian troops had entered Iraqi territory on Thursday and spent several hours at an oilfield. For more see [ID:nN18220780].\par \par \uc2  The dollar often rallies when investors move money from riskier emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the safe-haven greenback. Other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Latin America such as the Mexican peso <MXN=> and the Brazilian real <BRBY> booked heavy losses on the stronger dollar this week.  (Reporting by Rodrigo Martinez; Writing by Alonso Soto; Editing by James Dalgleish)   \par \par \uc2 CHILE-PESO/CENTRALBANK|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020091218e5ci001dy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
