\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  cenbank does not rule out peso  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 750 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 2009\par 13:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  renews \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  warning\par \par \uc2 * Peso up almost 30 percent vs US dollar year-to-date (Updates with peso close, regional comparisons)\par \par \uc2 By Alonso Soto\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Nov 19 (Reuters) - Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jose De Gregorio said on Thursday that he is not ruling out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the country's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, which has seen the Chilean peso <CLP=CL>, soar 28 percent against the U.S. dollar this year.\par \par \uc2 "We do not rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the future," De Gregorio said at the bank's annual conference in Santiago, reiterating a warning he made last week.\par \par \uc2 The peso has been one of the highest-performing emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year against a weaker dollar and is trading around 16-month highs. Some analysts expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the peso reaches 480 per dollar.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso slid more than 1.6 percent on Thursday, its biggest one-day percentage fall in nearly 7 months, easing on broad-based dollar strength, global stock losses and lower prices for copper, the country's No. 1 export.\par \par \uc2 Traders said the peso, which was already down around 1 percent before De Gregorio's comments, was unfazed by the fresh threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and even firmed initially after he spoke, though his comments were seen underpinning a continued slide later in the session.\par \par \uc2 Traders said the fall was not influenced by weakness in the Brazilian real after that country announced a new, 1.5 percent tax when overseas investors convert U.S.-listed shares of Brazilian companies into local shares. That move drove other emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower as investors worried about the introduction of capital controls to stem speculative flows.\par \par \uc2 "In economies with inflation targets, the first line of defense is monetary policy," De Gregorio said. "If there is a persistent appreciation, with deflationary consequences, the apt response would be a relaxation of monetary policy, reducing pressure on the appreciation," De Gregorio said.\par \par \uc2 "However, this is not always enough, and for that reason you can also use sterilized \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," he added.\par \par \uc2 De Gregorio had warned last week that the bank was monitoring the exchange rate very closely and that \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's free-float system left room for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in extreme circumstances.\par \par \uc2 FRESH \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  ON CARDS?\par \par \uc2 Last year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market through a dollar purchase program to build up its reserves, after the peso rose to 430 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 The bank held its benchmark overnight lending rate steady at 0.50 percent last week, saying that the rate would remain at that level until at least the second quarter. The bank also said it would relax complementary stimulus measures but hinted at a more gradual recovery in the economy of the world's top copper producer.\par \par \uc2 The bank said it would gradually reduce the term of a liquidity facility for banks, unveiled in July in a bid to help fend off the global crisis, and end the facility in May 2010.\par \par \uc2 Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is targeting inflation of 3 percent over a two-year horizon, and has slashed its key rate by 775 basis points since the beginning of the year, leading the charge to cut rates in Latin America.\par \par \uc2 Beyond verbal warnings to the market, analysts say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's options included buying dollars and issuing bonds to absorb the extra peso liquidity.\par \par \uc2 Another option would be for a non-sterilized \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , whereby the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buys dollars to inject peso liquidity while unwinding credit facilities at a stepped-up rate to mitigate the affects of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Third quarter gross domestic product data released on Wednesday showed Chile's economy was turning the corner on global crisis.\par \par \uc2 On an annual basis, Chile's third-quarter GDP shrank 1.6 percent from the year-earlier quarter, slowing the pace of decline from a revised 4.7 percent drop in the second quarter.\par \par \uc2 But GDP in the third quarter grew 1.1 percent from the second quarter, as calculated on a seasonally adjusted basis.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  forecast Chile's economy will contract 1.5 percent to 2 percent this year after the global slowdown curbed international copper demand but sees growth next year of 4.5 percent to 5.5 percent. (Writing by Simon Gardner; Editing by Padraic Cassidy)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CHILE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CENBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020091119e5bj000xe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
