\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Finmin applauds end to cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 144 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 September 2008\par 20:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 VALPARAISO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Sept 30 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Finance Minister on Tuesday applauded the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decision to cut short an $8 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program, saying it would help ensure greater dollar liquidity.\par \par \uc2 "I agree with and applaud the aim of measures the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  took yesterday to guarantee Chilean financial market players access to greater dollar liquidity," minister Andres Velasco told reporters in the port city of Valparaiso.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  halted the program, under which it bought $50 million worth of greenbacks daily, on Monday, citing international financial turbulence. The plan was originally introduced in April to reverse a sharp appreciation of the peso <CLP=CL> <CHILJ> earlier in the year. (Reporting by Rodrigo Martinez; Editing by Theodore d'Afflisio)\par \par \uc2 CHILE-ECONOMY/VELASCO (URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080930e49u001j0\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) a